<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n26936" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">lōmentum</span></b> , i, n.
		lavo, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a mixture of bean-meal and rice kneaded together, used by the
				Roman ladies for preserving the smoothness of their skin</i>.
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">lomento rugas condere,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Mart.
					3, 42, 1</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ex faba lomentum factum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Pall. Oct. 14, 9</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b>
			<i>A kind of blue color, azure</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">lomentum est caeruleo candidius,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					33, 13, 57, § 162</span></i>
			. —</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>Bean-meal</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">lomentum appellatur ea farina,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					18, 12, 30, § 117</span></i>
			.—* </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>, <i>a wash,
			cosmetic</i>, Cael. ap. <i><span class="en">Cic. Fam. 8, 14, 4</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
